{"id":"wb-5-284","name":"退思园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"退思园","text":"退思园，位于江苏省苏州市吴江区同里镇，是中国江南园林代表之一，建于清朝光绪十一至十三年，取意自《左传》“进思尽忠，退思补过”。退思园的设计者袁龙巧妙利用不到四亩面积，设计了坐春望月书楼、琴房、退思草堂、闹红一舸、眠云亭等建筑。亭阁、长廊环水而建。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%80%80%E6%80%9D%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":94089313,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94089313","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb57c2f12b2382747ce44b75.jpg","title":"Tusi.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tusi.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/Tusi.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5","caption":"Tuisi Garden (Retreat & Reflection Garden) 江苏吴江同里退思园 — Suzhou.","width":320,"height":217}}